                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "This is what the disastrous government run Unaffordable Care Act is driving us towards. While getting cancer treatment in Canada can average 28 weeks - allowing cancers to worsen and metastasize, cancer treatment in the US can average 28 days.\n\nIt\u2019s time to end the fraudulent, proven lie of the Unaffordable Care Act and allow Americans a much broader array of options including getting health insurance through large groups like Costco or Amazon memberships to create massive purchasing power, drive down premiums and deductibles, and put patients in charge of healthcare options.",
